# Select Face Edges from the context menu: the top face of the extrusion
# of path_extrude, right-clicked, offers Select Face Edges, which selects
# its four edges in place of the face; Chamfer Edges from the same menu
# then takes them. Undo takes the chamfer back whole.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
move 290 265
popup Select Face Edges
down R 290 265
up R 290 265
dump
menu Features|Chamfer Edges
dump
key z ctrl
dump
